      "title": "MiniMax H3 Reference-to-Video + Semantic Bridge + LoRA",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MiniMax H3 Reference-to-Video + Semantic Bridge + LoRA\n\n**All wires are fully pre-connected for Image Reference (`<Picture 1>`) with synthesized stereo audio (`VAE Decode Audio`).**\n\n### 1. Semantic Bridge Adapter (Node #145)\n- **Adapter**: `MiniMaxH3_SemanticBridge_v1.safetensors`\n- **Alpha**: `0.08` (conservative recommended value for Ref2VA)\n- **Magnitude Match**: `per_token`\n- *Author Note*: Semantic Bridge was distilled on standard text conditioning. In Ref2VA, keep alpha between `0.05 - 0.10` to enhance prompt grounding without degrading reference facial/lip articulation.\n\n### 2. UNET Loader (Diffusion Model)\n- **Singularity**: `Minimax-h3_Singularity_ref2va_Pruned_v1.3_int8.safetensors`\n- **Stock Ref2VA**: `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n\n### 3. LoRA Chain\n- **LoRA 1**: Character / Style (`strength = 0.4` default)\n- **LoRA 2**: Turbo / FL2V acceleration (optional, bypassed by default)\n\n### 4. Reference Image & Audio\n- Use `<Picture 1>` in **Text Prompt** (Node #138) to reference **Reference Image 0** (`#137`).\n- No reference video plugin is attached; Stage 1 synthesizes audio directly via `VAE Decode (Audio)` (`#121`).\n- Use **Stage 2 Upscale & Pre-Approve Mode** (Node `#192`, below Prompt & Resolution) to pre-select **2x**, **4x**, **Custom**, **Ask Approval**, or **Draft Only**."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# MiniMax H3 Reference-to-Video + Semantic Bridge + LoRA\n\n**All wires are fully pre-connected for Image Reference (`<Picture 1>`) with synthesized stereo audio (`VAE Decode Audio`).**\n\n### 1. Semantic Bridge Adapter (Node #145)\n- **Adapter**: `MiniMaxH3_SemanticBridge_v1.safetensors`\n- **Alpha**: `0.08` (conservative recommended value for Ref2VA)\n- **Magnitude Match**: `per_token`\n- *Author Note*: Semantic Bridge was distilled on standard text conditioning. In Ref2VA, keep alpha between `0.05 - 0.10` to enhance prompt grounding without degrading reference facial/lip articulation.\n\n### 2. UNET Loader (Diffusion Model)\n- **Singularity**: `Minimax-h3_Singularity_ref2va_Pruned_v1.3_int8.safetensors`\n- **Stock Ref2VA**: `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n\n### 3. LoRA Chain\n- **LoRA 1**: Character / Style (`strength = 0.4` default)\n- **LoRA 2**: Turbo / FL2V acceleration (optional, bypassed by default)\n\n### 4. Reference Image & Audio\n- Use `<Picture 1>` in **Text Prompt** (Node #138) to reference **Reference Image 0** (`#137`).\n- No reference video plugin is attached; Stage 1 synthesizes audio directly via `VAE Decode (Audio)` (`#121`).\n- Use **Stage 2 Upscale & Pre-Approve Mode** (Node `#192`, below Prompt & Resolution) to pre-select **2x**, **4x**, **Custom**, **Ask Approval**, or **Draft Only**."
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
